<title>SOUTH AFRICA: NU-WORLD INTERIM SHR JUMPS, NO DIV.</title>
<headline>NU-WORLD INTERIM SHR JUMPS, NO DIV.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended February</p>
<p>28, 1997</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)	 </p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)	 24.0	vs    15.9</p>
<p>    Shr, weighted (cts)     24.1	vs    17.2</p>
<p>    Attrib income	     4.27	vs    2.81</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		     5.71	vs    3.76</p>
<p>    Tax			   1.44	vs    0.95</p>
<p>    Interest paid	     2.91	vs    1.77</p>
<p>    Turnover		  148.25	vs    109.38</p>
<p>Full name: Nu-world Holdings Ltd (electronics and</p>
<p>electrical)</p>
<p>NOTE - It is company policy to declare a single dividend at</p>
<p>the end of a financial year. </p>
<p>The company said its prospects for the remainder of the</p>
<p>financial year looked exceedingly promising and it was</p>
<p>anticipating a good winter season with a range of products on</p>
<p>offer from gas heaters to electric blankets.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
